{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4d91783d67b51caf9d43edf46c68160bc15fa6d5c203966d3c85a771a3baaf9a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_b:2_4_026_02_09_b:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9cb96904ec06cfcc4ea9c9f2b82fecb4263dc70be50f49e4c7a49a0f521ba82",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●番长。\n现在手头有空吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_b:2_4_026_02_09_b:cmd-000009:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d59ed6eef70242ae5ae93b830938a6c427fd132ab8015aae763fcba9d35b9fc",
      "text": "有空",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_b:2_4_026_02_09_b:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ae563d401510c89e64ef36e736fa333ed63c370ef668eb12d0e60ea4630db61",
      "text": "出什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_b:2_4_026_02_09_b:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a17809e7382e6c559d7ad5e8ca3062716221c96ebb0751e33ae8826387bc6a0",
      "text": "我在参观企鹅水槽，\n听说好像有个喂食体验项目。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_b:2_4_026_02_09_b:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df9c926a045dbdd45d7b8cee8237f0e7c13e75e3ec99e46b0c3c3aaebb631f27",
      "text": "工作人员问我，\n要不要参加看看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_b:2_4_026_02_09_b:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:901a7b994fc1a3f9b297515223cb9ae8f83df2250aec491013996799f7876dd8",
      "text": "反正都要体验，番长和其他成员\n要不要也一起来试试？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_b:2_4_026_02_09_b:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71a5f021426215bc15a1d84c82973d84e1ca4c440af07d450433218b572160e2",
      "text": "我也去跟其他大家\n说一声！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_b:2_4_026_02_09_b:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f42abac964713a61982ccec92f280edb0184bfc5616854e408dd8f2f136ba775",
      "text": "嗯。走到体验区附近的话，\n会有指示牌，应该一眼就能认出来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_b:2_4_026_02_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdcc4f85bbf2d4458e4f4d931cfd508b712ec22ead8186c167557505232c65f5",
      "text": "话说回来，就算是同样的企鹅，个性也是\n大不相同啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_b:2_4_026_02_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d5c6a192943c8b27a8b55db168dc1e664b1afde8f9d528fe320aa5dec281a57",
      "text": "有的满脸等不及的样子盯着这边，\n也有的老老实实地待在一旁等候。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_b:2_4_026_02_09_b:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53131c3b80160a3fa5e19468df4ce1d402289708d474e037498f422094992a94",
      "text": "……哦，这家伙还挺贪吃的啊。\n有骨气的家伙我可不讨厌。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_b:2_4_026_02_09_b:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32dc6600cae1ee227bbd6f01ca8fb3e072e64c581c977a897e28b6b97b5024aa",
      "text": "越了解越觉得是群有意思的家伙。\n这下拍摄也让人期待起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_b:2_4_026_02_09_b:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c663afe0195e6435cafb355f2ebfc8df1a12f122a71831dd6e6010ba0209aee6",
      "text": "在番长你们过来之前，我就边陪这些家伙边等你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
